l and be shamed from the blonde hair angel. (Height 170cm)\n\nBlonde hair (攻め)is an anti-Christian angel in heaven with blonde hair and red eyes, he hated Christianly a lot so he love humiliate god in front of white hair angel and also love to control and dominate the white hair angel.(Height 165cm)\n\nThey are childhood sweethearts\n\nThank you so much!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10XQmQSlGuyoZTNDJvmlm9jNa4z8vioUy", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@AS4KLA/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 651067, "client_id": 1320941, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca86b08c/uploads/origins/10959ae4-cfaf-47ed-8402-06ebe4f94b57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3bc6a7dc0361d3e726cffc6e3c0cf2e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca86b08c/uploads/origins/10959ae4-cfaf-47ed-8402-06ebe4f94b57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3bc6a7dc0361d3e726cffc6e3c0cf2e, https://si.imgix.net/ca86b08c/uploads/origins/10959ae4-cfaf-47ed-8402-06ebe4f94b57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23baedbe8692defedea6239e6cede452 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ca86b08c/uploads/origins/10959ae4-cfaf-47ed-8402-06ebe4f94b57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=313dfaa47bacc03c5a1e5f21c98e460b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca86b08c/uploads/origins/10959ae4-cfaf-47ed-8402-06ebe4f94b57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d00c0181ea00ebfe099409f9eb60dbf2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ca86b08c/uploads/origins/10959ae4-cfaf-47ed-8402-06ebe4f94b57?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=